{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Arial;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fs24\b APK Analyzer Pro - Project Documentation\b0\par\par\b 1. Project Overview\b0\par APK Analyzer Pro is a Kotlin-based application designed to inspect Android APK files and generate a detailed report. The project includes a desktop Swing interface, backend API support using Ktor, APK metadata extraction, and HTML report generation.\par\par\b 2. Objectives\b0\par - Analyze APK package details\par - Read manifest metadata\par - Extract app permissions and components\par - Generate a report for application review\par - Provide API-based integration for backend usage\par\par\b 3. Key Features\b0\par\b Desktop Features\b0\par - Select APK with file chooser\par - Validate file type\par - View summary cards\par - Analyze manifest information\par - Show detailed report in UI\par - Save HTML report beside the APK\par\par\b Backend Features\b0\par - Run Ktor server\par - Upload APK using multipart form\par - Return JSON analysis result\par - Expose health check endpoint\par\par\b Analysis Features\b0\par - Package name\par - Version name and version code\par - Min SDK and Target SDK\par - App label and app icon values\par - Permissions list\par - Activities, services, receivers, providers\par - Native libraries\par - META-INF files\par - SHA-256 hash\par - File size\par\par\b 4. Technical Stack\b0\par - Kotlin\par - Gradle\par - Swing\par - Ktor\par - Java XML parser\par - ZIP file handling\par\par\b 5. Project Structure\b0\par - src/main/kotlin/com/example/apkreport/Main.kt\par - src/main/kotlin/com/example/apkreport/Backend.kt\par - build.gradle.kts\par - README.md\par - docs/\par\par\b 6. How to Run\b0\par\b Desktop UI\b0\par gradle run\par Then click Browse and select an APK file.\par\par\b Backend API\b0\par gradle run --args="--backend"\par\par Health check: http://localhost:8080/health\par\par Upload endpoint: POST http://localhost:8080/api/analyze\par Use multipart form with a field named file.\par\par\b 7. Output\b0\par The application creates an HTML report generated in the same folder as the APK file.\par\par\b 8. Limitations\b0\par This project performs static analysis of the APK archive and manifest. It does not install, execute, or emulate the app.\par\par\b 9. Future Enhancements\b0\par - database storage\par - report history\par - advanced security checks\par - PDF export\par - user authentication\par - dark mode UI\par - web dashboard integration\par\par\b 10. Conclusion\b0\par APK Analyzer Pro is a practical solution for static APK inspection, metadata extraction, and API-based integration for Kotlin projects.\par}\par